{"id":"611328","name":"嫩南瓜肉饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/611328/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"嫩南瓜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"猪肉糜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"面团","amount":"80g"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取嫩南瓜。","img":"images/611328/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切片。","img":"images/611328/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/611328/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱姜切末。","img":"images/611328/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取肉糜。","img":"images/611328/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"所有食材放一起，加食用油，食盐，鸡精和生抽。","img":"images/611328/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/611328/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取面图案，揉光。","img":"images/611328/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/611328/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"包起来。","img":"images/611328/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"压扁。","img":"images/611328/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"锅烧热，放肉饼。","img":"images/611328/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"淋小许食用油，一面煎金黄翻面。","img":"images/611328/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"继续翻面。","img":"images/611328/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"直到边边煎至透明，按压快速回弹即可。","img":"images/611328/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/611328/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"有比较丰富的汤汁，咬一口很是鲜香。","img":"images/611328/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}